{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anywhere, Any Size\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udcbb\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udcbb</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put ZETA kun wherever you want on your screen. Just drag and drop him to your favorite spot, and resize him freely so he never gets in the way of your work or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/64d95fdde47907c2a027ec576e077cda.poster.avif?t=1772150418\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/64d95fdde47907c2a027ec576e077cda.webm?t=1772150418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/64d95fdde47907c2a027ec576e077cda.mp4?t=1772150418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He's Always Doing Something\ud83d\udc40\u2728\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZETA kun is more than just an idle mascot\u2014he\u2019s constantly moving  like he\u2019s truly alive. Spotted a rare action? NICE! You're lucky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/15abe278e59fc73146b58e5b391e3d8e.poster.avif?t=1772150418\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/15abe278e59fc73146b58e5b391e3d8e.webm?t=1772150418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always with you\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep ZETA kun on top of your windows so he's always by your side, whether you're gaming or working. Capture and save those moments with him as a special memory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/d9fa255c7833384022a9dda716b92e61.poster.avif?t=1772150418\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/d9fa255c7833384022a9dda716b92e61.webm?t=1772150418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Streaming</strong>\u26a1\ufe0f\u26a1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can have him join your streams! Let your community watch over him with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/f47edf9fb8ac02b0c17ae581c0818658.webp?t=1772150418\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/f47edf9fb8ac02b0c17ae581c0818658.poster.avif?t=1772150418\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=500 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Guidelines\ud83e\udd1d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to share ZETA kun on social media and livestreams. Just remember that he's all about having a good time, so please don't use him in any way that could hurt someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/28101f0487a787d987e950ce08c39b79.poster.avif?t=1772150418\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840500/extras/28101f0487a787d987e950ce08c39b79.webm?t=1772150418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","backgroun